### Endpoint

`GET https://api.heygen.com/v1/workflows/executions/{execution_id}`

### curl

```bash
curl -X GET "https://api.heygen.com/v1/workflows/executions/node-gw-v1d2e3o4" \
  -H "X-Api-Key: $HEYGEN_API_KEY"
```

### Response Format (Completed)

